{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_140_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_140","textTraditional":"一、八年，春，晉侯使韓穿來言汶陽之田，歸之於齊。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_140_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_140","textTraditional":"於齊，緩辭也，不使盡我也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_140_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_140","textTraditional":"二、晉欒書帥師侵蔡。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_140_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_140","textTraditional":"三、公孫嬰齊如莒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_140_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_140","textTraditional":"四、宋公使華元來聘。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_140_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_140","textTraditional":"五、夏，宋公使公孫壽來納幣。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_140_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_140","textTraditional":"六、晉殺其大夫趙同、趙括。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_140_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_140","textTraditional":"七、秋，七月，天子使召伯來錫公命。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_140_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_140","textTraditional":"禮有受命，無來錫命，錫命，非正也。曰天子何也？曰，見一稱也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_140_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_140","textTraditional":"八、冬，十月，癸卯，杞叔姬卒。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_140_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_140","textTraditional":"九、晉侯使士燮來聘。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_140_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_140","textTraditional":"十、叔孫僑如會晉士燮、齊人、邾人伐郯。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_140_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_140","textTraditional":"十一、衞人來媵。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_140_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_140","textTraditional":"媵，淺事也，不志。此其志何也？以伯姬之不得其所，故盡其事也。","sentenceOrder":14}],"overrides":{}}